"""Gym Member Segmentation & Clustering
=======================================
An end-to-end, CRISP-DM-structured unsupervised-learning portfolio project that
segments gym members into actionable fitness personas.

Two datasets are switchable from the sidebar:

* **Real (Kaggle)** — 973 real gym sessions from the "Gym Members Exercise
  Dataset". Honest, messy, fairly continuous data: natural clusters are weak,
  which makes feature selection and metric choice genuinely matter.
* **Synthetic personas** — generated by ``generate_data.py`` with five known
  fitness personas baked in, so the pipeline can be validated against ground
  truth (Adjusted Rand Index).

Pipeline: EDA -> feature selection (multicollinearity-aware) -> scaling ->
K-Means / Agglomerative / GMM / DBSCAN -> multi-metric evaluation ->
auto-named personas -> live scoring of new members.

Run:
    streamlit run app.py
"""

